    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471060/extras/c18ca6263248e88236faff822ece27fa.poster.avif?t=1743540302\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471060/extras/c18ca6263248e88236faff822ece27fa.webm?t=1743540302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sweet Delights: The Girl\u2019s Cafe Quest&quot; \u2014 an engaging hidden object game where your ultimate reward is spending time with stunning anime girls. \ud83c\udf38\u2728 Explore vibrant locations, find hidden items, and unlock new scenes featuring charming heroines. \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc96</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game features a scroll system, allowing you to zoom in on important moments for a more immersive experience! \ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udfae</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471060/extras/7439963c9ae426cc8270a1ec39844ccf.avif?t=1743540302\" width=800 height=533 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/